From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gopikrishna Garmidi <gopikrishna.garmidi@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 02:50:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: qcom: scm: Allow QSEECOM on Surface Laptop 8th
 Edition

Allow the use of QSEECOM on the Mahua-based Microsoft Surface Laptop
13.8" 8th Edition, giving access to the UEFI variables and the RTC
offset stored there.

Signed-off-by: Gopikrishna Garmidi <gopikrishna.garmidi@oss.qualcomm.com>
Reviewed-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20261006-mahua-surface-laptop-v1-2-406fc042162a@oss.qualcomm.com
[Jim Martin: use the compatible of the board DT carried here until the
 board name is settled upstream; context adapted to v7.3-rc6]
Signed-off-by: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
index 3eaa4c9ccf3..42838a339e4 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
@@ -2326,6 +2326,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_scm_qseecom_allowlist[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "microsoft,denali", },
 	{ .compatible = "microsoft,romulus13", },
 	{ .compatible = "microsoft,romulus15", },
+	{ .compatible = "microsoft,surface-laptop8", },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,glymur-crd" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,hamoa-iot-evk" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,mahua-crd" },
-- 
2.56.0

